{"bangumi":{"date":"2009-05-24","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg"},"summary":"在光坂高中空无一人的教室内，藤林椋终于鼓起勇气向被人当作不良少年的冈崎朋也表白。幸运的是，她的爱意没有落于虚空，得到了冈崎热情而肯定的回应。两人自此开始交往，望着沉浸在幸福中的妹妹，藤林杏心中自是无法道出的复杂感受。某个明媚的假日，冈崎和杏在公园不期而遇。杏半开玩笑地教冈崎把自己当作椋练习接吻，谁知这一幕却被同学看见，第二天便在学校内传得风言风语。为了消除谣言，杏甚至假装和春原阳平交往。甜蜜又青涩的学生时代，说不清道不明的爱恋情怀……","name":"CLANNAD 〜AFTER STORY〜もうひとつの世界 杏編","name_cn":"CLANNAD ～AFTER STORY～另一个世界 杏篇","tags":[{"name":"京阿尼","count":2090,"total_count":214932},{"name":"OVA","count":1793,"total_count":366805},{"name":"Clannad","count":1768,"total_count":20980},{"name":"key","count":1470,"total_count":47162},{"name":"GAL改","count":997,"total_count":78912},{"name":"2009","count":770,"total_count":39481},{"name":"校园","count":768,"total_count":456793},{"name":"杏篇","count":745,"total_count":745},{"name":"麻枝准","count":725,"total_count":23371},{"name":"催泪","count":679,"total_count":60554},{"name":"治愈","count":518,"total_count":303368},{"name":"游戏改","count":468,"total_count":163462},{"name":"恋爱","count":436,"total_count":568197},{"name":"短发杏","count":280,"total_count":280},{"name":"石原立也","count":232,"total_count":16224},{"name":"京都动画","count":153,"total_count":33161},{"name":"日本","count":110,"total_count":300777},{"name":"京都","count":90,"total_count":7705},{"name":"STORY～もうひとつの世界","count":46,"total_count":46},{"name":"2009年5月","count":46,"total_count":132},{"name":"京都アニメーション","count":45,"total_count":6524},{"name":"2009年","count":40,"total_count":2043},{"name":"日常","count":25,"total_count":403338},{"name":"神作","count":22,"total_count":48038},{"name":"番外","count":19,"total_count":4323},{"name":"人生","count":18,"total_count":11981},{"name":"TV","count":16,"total_count":1